[
  {
    "content_id": "10032001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和華對亞米太的兒子約拿說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「你起來前往尼尼微大城，大聲警告那裡的居民，因為他們的罪惡滔天，已經達到我面前。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;可是，約拿卻起身逃往他施，想躲避耶和華。他到了約帕港，找到一艘要開往他施的船，就付了船費，上了船，想和眾人一起去他施，好躲避耶和華。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;然而，耶和華使海面起了狂風，滔天巨浪幾乎把船打成碎片。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;水手們非常害怕，紛紛呼求自己的神明，又把船上的貨物全都拋進海裡，以減輕重量。這時候，約拿已下到底艙，躺在那裡呼呼大睡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;船長來到約拿身邊對他說：「你這個人，怎麼這時候還在睡覺！快起來祈求你的神明吧，也許你的神明會憐憫我們，使我們不致滅亡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;後來，船上的人彼此商量說：「來，我們抽籤，看看這場災難是誰惹來的。」於是他們就抽籤，結果抽中了約拿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;眾人問他：「請告訴我們，這場災難是誰惹來的？你是做什麼的？從哪裡來？是哪一國、哪一族的人？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;約拿回答說：「我是希伯來人，我敬畏天上的上帝耶和華，祂創造了海洋和陸地。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;之後，他就把怎樣逃避耶和華的事告訴他們。眾人知道後，萬分恐懼，責問他：「你怎麼做出這種事？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;那時，風浪越來越大，他們便對約拿說：「我們要怎樣處置你，才能使風浪平靜呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;約拿對他們說：「我知道遭遇這場風暴是因我而起的，你們把我抬起來拋進海裡，風浪自然會平靜。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;然而船上的人還是拚命划船，希望把船划向岸邊，可是沒有成功，因為風浪越來越大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他們只好呼求耶和華，說：「耶和華啊，求你不要因這個人的性命而毀滅我們，不要因我們殺害無辜的人而怪罪我們，因為你耶和華按自己的旨意行事。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;然後他們把約拿抬起來拋進海裡，狂風巨浪立刻就平靜了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;眾人都極其敬畏耶和華，向祂獻祭，並且許願。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和華安排了一條大魚把約拿吞下，他在魚腹裡度過了三日三夜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;約拿在魚腹中向他的上帝耶和華禱告說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「耶和華啊，我遭遇患難的時候向你求告， 你就應允我。 我在陰間的深處呼求你， 你也垂聽我的聲音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你把我拋進深海， 拋進大洋的腹地， 洋流圍困我， 你的巨浪洪濤淹沒我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我心想，我從你面前被趕走， 但我還要再瞻仰你的聖殿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波濤吞噬我， 深海圍困我， 海草纏繞著我的頭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我下沉到山的根基， 大地的門閂把我永遠關住； 然而，我的上帝耶和華啊， 你卻把我的性命從深坑中拯救出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我的生命漸漸消逝的時候， 我就想起了耶和華。 我的禱告進入你的聖殿， 達到你面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那些信奉虛無神明的人， 背棄了憐愛他們的上帝，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但我要用感謝的聲音向你獻祭， 我必還我許的願， 因為救恩來自耶和華。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;於是，耶和華命令那條魚， 魚就把約拿吐到陸地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和華第二次對約拿說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「你起身前往尼尼微大城，向那裡的居民宣告我先前吩咐你的話。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;約拿便照耶和華的吩咐前往尼尼微城。尼尼微城很大，要三天才能走遍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;約拿進城走了一天，宣告說：「再過四十天尼尼微就要毀滅了！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微城的人相信了上帝的話，便宣告禁食，所有的人，無論大小貴賤都披上麻衣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微王聽到這消息後，便走下寶座，脫下王袍，披上麻衣，坐在爐灰中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;王又向全城頒佈通告，說：「王和大臣有令，所有的人都必須禁食，牛羊牲畜都不許吃草也不許喝水。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;人和牲畜都必須披上麻衣，眾人要向上帝懇切呼求，改邪歸正，停止作惡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝或許會心生憐憫，收回烈怒，使我們不致滅亡，也未可知。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;上帝看見他們改邪歸正，不再作惡，就心生憐憫，沒有像所說的那樣毀滅他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;這事令約拿十分不悅，非常惱怒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他向耶和華禱告說：「耶和華啊，我在家鄉的時候豈不早就說過你會這樣做嗎？我知道你是一位有恩典、好憐憫的上帝，不輕易發怒，充滿慈愛，不忍心降災，所以我才急速逃往他施。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，求你收回我的性命吧，我死了比活著還好！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和華對他說：「你這樣大發脾氣合理嗎？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;約拿出城，在城東為自己搭了一個棚，坐在棚下蔭涼處，要看看尼尼微城究竟會怎樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和華上帝安排了一棵蓖麻迅速地長起來，為約拿遮蔭，使他的頭免受日曬。約拿因有這棵蓖麻而非常歡喜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;第二天黎明的時候，上帝卻安排了一條蟲來咬這棵蓖麻，蓖麻就枯萎了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;太陽出來的時候，上帝颳起燥熱的東風，烈日把約拿曬得發昏，他就再次求死說：「我死了比活著還好！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝對約拿說：「你為這棵蓖麻大發脾氣合理嗎？」約拿回答說：「我就是氣死了也合理。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說：「這棵蓖麻不是你種的，也不是你栽培的，它在一夜之間長成，又在一夜之間死去，你尚且如此愛惜，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
